{"version":1,"content":"<p>一款搖搖擺擺、發出鴨子叫聲的機械人摔倒後可以自主站起。這款復刻鴨子外形與步態的機械人名叫Microduck，由法國企業Pollen Robotics研發。英偉達CEO黃仁勳親自演示這款機械人後，它受到全球關注，市場目光也隨之轉向為它提供核心舵機的韓國機械人企業Robotis。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584200.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:41:09.652641+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T15:28:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T15:38:16.530565+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:38:16.530565+00:00","content_hash":"2571a17c6b6e5432528f02e00ab024823688c9b93830911e8c171a1a2815d414","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}